## Stack

- Next.js 16 (App Router, Turbopack)
- React 19 / TypeScript 5.9
- Tailwind CSS 4 + shadcn/ui primitives
- Lucide icons
- Zod validation
- Motion for restrained scroll reveals and interaction feedback
- Pino server logging
- Jest + Testing Library
- Route Handler API under `src/app/api`
- Feature overlays: Postgres/Drizzle, Better Auth + React Hook Form, Zustand,
  Playwright E2E, PostHog, Docker, CI

Package manager: `{{.package_manager}}` (also supported: pnpm, npm, bun).

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Browser --> Pages[App Router pages]
    Pages --> Server[Server components and route handlers]
    Server --> Validation[Zod boundaries]
    Server --> Auth[Auth/session overlay]
    Server --> DB[(Postgres/Drizzle)]
    Pages --> State[Zustand selectors]
```

